# ~/.config/Brewfile
# Declarative Homebrew manifest for this machine. `brew bundle` (run by
# bootstrap.sh) installs everything listed here; the `brew` fish wrapper keeps
# this file in sync via `brew bundle dump` after every install/uninstall.
#
# Edit by hand or just `brew install ...` / `brew uninstall ...` in fish and let
# the wrapper update this file. Config/symlink steps that are not brew packages
# live in bootstrap/**/install-*.sh and run after the bundle.

